flowchart LR
  %% Main wiring
  Main["main.dart\n(App start)"] --> ApiHelper["ApiHelper"]
  Main --> AuthLocal["AuthLocalDataSourceImpl\n(SharedPreferences)"]
  Main --> UserRepo["UserRepositoryImpl\n(apiHelper, authLocal)"]
  Main --> GetSaved["GetSavedUserUseCase\n(userRepository)"]
  Main --> SessionBloc["SessionBloc\n(getSavedUserUseCase)"]
  Main --> LoginBloc["LoginBloc\n(userRepository, sessionBloc)"]
  Main --> RegisterBloc["RegisterBloc\n(userRepository)"]

  %% App startup: session load
  SessionBloc -.->|add LoadUserFromPrefsEvent() on create| GetSaved
  GetSaved -->|calls repository.getSavedUser()| UserRepo
  UserRepo -->|delegates to| AuthLocal
  AuthLocal --> SharedPrefs["SharedPreferences\n(user_json, token)"]
  AuthLocal -->|returns user json| GetSaved
  GetSaved -->|user json or null| SessionBloc
  SessionBloc -->|emit authenticated / unauthenticated| UI["UI / Router"]

  %% Login flow
  UILogin["LoginForm (UI)"] -->|LoginSubmittedEvent| LoginBloc
  LoginBloc -->|calls loginUser(email,password)| UserRepo
  UserRepo -->|ApiHelper.postApi(...)| ApiHelper
  ApiHelper -->|HTTP POST| Server["Auth Server (API)"]
  Server -->|200 { status: 'success', data: {..., jwt_token}}| ApiHelper
  ApiHelper -->|returns parsed JSON| UserRepo
  UserRepo -->|on success: saveToken/saveUser| AuthLocal
  AuthLocal -->|writes token,user| SharedPrefs
  UserRepo -->|returns response| LoginBloc
  LoginBloc -->|create UserModel and emit success| UI
  LoginBloc -->|session update| SessionBloc
  SessionBloc -->|emit authenticated| UI

  %% Subsequent API calls
  UI -->|user action| SomeFeatureBloc
  SomeFeatureBloc -->|ApiHelper.getApi() uses getToken()| ApiHelper
  ApiHelper -->|reads token from| SharedPrefs
  SharedPrefs -->|provides token| ApiHelper
  ApiHelper -->|sends Authorization: Bearer <token>| Server
